# github.com/deuxdoom/PICVIUM is a DISTRIBUTION-ONLY repository (devdocs/DECISIONS.md D-011).
# Everything is ignored by default; only the distribution files below are allow-listed.
# Source code, tests, scripts, tools, assets, developer docs and build output stay local and are never committed.
# A second guard (scripts/git-hooks, enabled via core.hooksPath) rejects anything outside this list even with `git add -f`.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/License.md
!/docs/
!/licenses/
